<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel targets over 100 bln yen current prft.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel targets over 100 bln yen current prft.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp said on Tuesday it would aim at an annual parent current profit of more than 100 billion yen in its new medium-term management plan covering three years from next April 1.</p>
</text>
